+# Unique task ids and get(id)
+
+The app needs a stable reference to a task that survives a rename.
+
+- Every task has a unique `id` (string, set by `add`, never changed).
+- `list.get(id)` returns the task as a `Result` (`not-found` if unknown).
+- `find`, `complete`, `reopen`, `rename`, `tag`, `untag` and `remove` accept a task's id as well as its title.
+
+Done in `src/domain/task.ts` and `src/domain/list.ts`, with tests in `test/list.test.ts`.
